{"4817390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DIGDLE", "steam_appid": 4817390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4972520], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIGDLE is a 3D nonogram puzzle game where you chisel away the wrong blocks to uncover everyday items buried in the dirt. Each row and column gives you a number clue. Figure out which blocks to remove and which to keep, and slowly reveal what's hiding inside. With hundreds of puzzles, DIGDLE is simple to learn but satisfying to master.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIGDLE is a 3D nonogram puzzle game where you chisel away the wrong blocks to uncover everyday items buried in the dirt. Each row and column gives you a number clue. Figure out which blocks to remove and which to keep, and slowly reveal what's hiding inside. With hundreds of puzzles, DIGDLE is simple to learn but satisfying to master.</p>", "short_description": "A 3D nonogram puzzler with 300+ puzzles across unlockable packs. Chisel dirt, hammer rock (3 hits), and shatter chain-linked amber to uncover buried objects. Race for stars, solve clean for Perfect badges, or use a hint — it leaves its own badge behind.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817390/dc1236743d4080538fac42ead87269ddf8684696/header.jpg?t=1784796197", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817390/33f6fa2568f7b08b62a0c11e68d00feb8358a247/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784796197", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817390/33f6fa2568f7b08b62a0c11e68d00feb8358a247/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784796197", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1